                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "571c35a4-d7ee-4b41-bc09-b09c5842ef60",
                        "source_entry_id": "a73c2ba1-dd1a-36bc-9183-fca54490b2f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "27736d33-338c-3a5f-82bd-b6f6bf661514",
                        "target_lang_word": "multinational",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "multinational",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77feea03-fb94-33c4-a7d3-59facbf6f20f",
                                        "entry_id": "34809c2d-e9ae-3e59-b23c-e27361faf04f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or involving more than two nations (externally between countries or internally in a country)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8766383-9a2f-4485-98d0-3272094ceb76",
                                                "sense_id": "77feea03-fb94-33c4-a7d3-59facbf6f20f",
                                                "text": "AS a young student at the multinational Aramco school in Dhahran, Saudi Arabia, Fadi Jaber, a son of Palestinian refugees, always preferred his American classmates’ cupcakes, brownies and chocolate chip cookies to his mother’s pastries: knafah, qatayef and baklawah."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                        "entry_id": "34809c2d-e9ae-3e59-b23c-e27361faf04f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Operating, or having subsidiary companies in multiple countries (especially more than two)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c2c312-6a42-4305-99d3-44690400d801",
                                                "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                                "text": "By operating within many nations, but ouside them at the same time, multinational firms create possibilities of change even in the world political structure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19f82e6f-a730-4460-a0c0-a5497e776fcb",
                                                "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                                "text": "Some managers seemed sympathetic to the study, although they encouraged me to recast it as a technical issue, such as the \"problem of executive succession in multinationals.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "multinational",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "224a40b6-8bec-3f64-b399-4b7c14f4da20",
                                        "entry_id": "eb9227d3-b17f-37f2-9c81-54ca112f4e92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A multinational company."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c968a4d-d4e4-495b-a8d3-84e35223e43a",
                                                "sense_id": "224a40b6-8bec-3f64-b399-4b7c14f4da20",
                                                "text": "The G8 leaders also called on multinationals to make a full disclosure to the taxman over how much tax they pay in different countries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e10ddba4-deb6-41a4-ae3e-39077b79d729",
                        "source_entry_id": "a73c2ba1-dd1a-36bc-9183-fca54490b2f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "27736d33-338c-3a5f-82bd-b6f6bf661514",
                        "target_lang_word": "multiethnic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "multiethnic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6a37c8f-99f9-32e5-aa21-9a6cb7cdcdac",
                                        "entry_id": "52eacad2-7f15-339c-b5a4-482ff5803651",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, pertaining to, or consisting of several ethnic groups."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "760b3379-98c9-4c1a-847b-00d738365b3e",
                                                "sense_id": "a6a37c8f-99f9-32e5-aa21-9a6cb7cdcdac",
                                                "text": "In general, they are propagating the image of Ukrainians as the European descendants of good peasant stock, of multiethnic pioneers, and of an ancient multiethnic state."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3eb20ed2-eba0-48bc-afdf-9f0f6a568229",
                                                "sense_id": "a6a37c8f-99f9-32e5-aa21-9a6cb7cdcdac",
                                                "text": "As a multicultural and multiethnic society, Singapore has four official languages: Malay, Mandarin, Tamil, and English, with Malay considered the national language and English as a nominally neutral ‘working language’ allowing communication across all communities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "multiethnic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07f7cd9c-1f71-361c-8c8e-91cb69b61f4c",
                                        "entry_id": "a256e309-ac1c-30c8-bec7-a69d5c625883",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of more than one ethnic group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "469ba5e1-caba-48f6-bbb9-d2e03e467fd2",
